# 2026-08-28 18:41:10.564320
+/code Redesign the manager home page in Dashboard.tsx to feel like an Apple work-focused interface. The header should show only a clear title 'Work' or 'العمل' with small language and theme toggles. The first section must be Pending Work Offers, with no distracting elements before it. The CelebritySwitcher should be extremely compact and appear only as a thin horizontal row of small avatars above the offers if more than one celebrity is managed. The inbox conversations section should come after the offers and feel calm and secondary. Use generous spacing, soft rounded cards, very light borders, and no clutter. Ensure RTL support. Keep all existing logic and handlers unchanged. Show the modified JSX sections for header, celebrity switcher, pending offers, and inbox.

